# aiming (runtime/free_move.cpp: the prototype's direct reload, PlReloadDirect 1) ended at PlReloadEndTbl's frame,
# after the reload motion had brought the pistol back up to aim, and then blended into his footwork over 15 frames
# (wepDown). pl_handgun.cpp wep02_r2_reload (all the handguns' modules) now ends it 4 frames after the weapon is full
# (re4_reload_quick_end, as the long guns): his footwork blended in over 6 frames (crouching: the crouch), the weapon
# object put down as wepDown does. Aiming, or the reload started from aiming (PlReloadDirect 0): unchanged. A port
# feature of the mods, not a fix of the prototype.
